#: data/org.garnish.Salle.desktop.in.in:3
#: data/org.garnish.Salle.metainfo.xml.in.in:7
msgid "Run and manage your virtual machines"
msgstr "Execute e gerencie suas máquinas virtuais"

#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons! The list MUST also end with a semicolon!
#: data/org.garnish.Salle.desktop.in.in:10
